Critical long-range conductance

Copied code

LongRange/HeatKernel/CriticalComplexification.lean is copied from Leonardo Bonanno's
lean-formalizations, https://github.com/leobon12/lean-formalizations, commit fdb5cad,
modules ReflectedGMS.Forms.ComplexSequenceSpace and ReflectedGMS.Forms.ComplexifiedOperator.
The two modules are concatenated, the namespace is renamed, the real sequence space is
defined in the file instead of being imported, and docstrings are shortened; statements and
proofs are unchanged. The header of the file lists these changes.

In LongRange/HeatKernel/CriticalOperatorSpectral.lean, the theorem inner_decomposition is
copied from the module ReflectedGMS.Forms.ComplexResolvent of the same repository and
commit, and complexify_isSelfAdjoint follows the proof of complexOneResolvent_isSelfAdjoint
in that module. The header of the file states this.

This code is copied source, not a dependency: the library builds without that repository.
